Game Copyright Notice (Army Men Series)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is an independent, fan-made Chinese localization ("translation
patch") for the Army Men video game series (Chinese title: 玩具兵大战).
It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the copyright
holders of those games.

Army Men (玩具兵大战) and all related titles, characters, artwork, music,
and trademarks are the property of their respective copyright holders.

Copyright (c) 1998 The 3DO Company. All rights reserved.

The 3DO Company is the original developer and publisher of the Army Men
series. This project makes no claim of rights in any game asset.

This project redistributes **no game assets**. It provides only translation
text and data that users must apply to their own legally acquired copies of
the games. The games themselves are not redistributed by this project and
remain governed by their own licenses and copyright.

