Notes
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This file describes the main license, additional terms, copyright notices,
third-party components, and disclaimer of this project.

The full license texts are located in the ./LICENSES/ directory.

Scope notes for this specific project:

  * The patch does NOT modify, redistribute or replace the game executable.
    `Armymen.exe` is never written to. All in-memory patching is performed at
    runtime by scripts\Army1_Extend_Dll.asi and is fully reversible.
  * Game asset differences in `update/` are extracted blocks taken from the
    user's own legally acquired copy of the localized retail release; no new
    artwork is authored by this project.
  * No stb / MinHook / Source Han Serif are used by this project. The font is
    the system-provided SimSun (宋体), selected at runtime via the game's own
    CreateFontA/CreateFontIndirectA.